{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2eb78c353554a6d8af69f9f470ad6b3ddd4ae5ff5f840f005aea0c079f97614e", "ja": "（今日は昴と営業に出た。仕事は早めに終わったが、\nあいにく、雨が降ってきてしまった……）", "zh": "（今天和昴一起出去跑了趟工作。工作虽然提早结束了，可偏偏下起雨来了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "1a8d462b3aa4919bd8daa5da00975cdf42a58f4d075a9a143a521b9bd8ad9a47", "ja": "あーあ……今日は{$P$}と\n遊べると思ったのに。急に降るんだもんなー。", "zh": "唉……我还以为今天能和{$P$}一起玩呢。谁知道突然下起雨来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cce00e42180a6bcab9de5b898fdb28f9393902a36c05caa3ae48050411efd289", "ja": "残念だったよな。\nせっかく仕事頑張ったのに……。", "zh": "真遗憾啊。好不容易努力工作了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "a1aa80125f342469e242582258c7b23416f6b1e4a49c3333b8881d3adbe8e31d", "ja": "雨降ると、なんかユーウツっていうか、\nイヤだよな。野球もできないし。", "zh": "一下雨就感觉有点郁闷，挺讨厌的。也没法打棒球。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "436092c3da6ab0ab016799a6f1ace1161a9e45a416e7aef0588960c7c14689c1", "ja": "それにほら、仕事でも野外イベントとかさー。\n突然休止になったりして、困るよな。", "zh": "而且你看，工作有时候也会遇到户外活动什么的。突然暂停的话，也挺让人头疼的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1005_p", "source_sha256": "957aa0ea82f448a5366a73902bc00bc3fa889787db1d7356d5a2fa0e93022d9d", "ja": "確かに。長雨にならなきゃいいけど……。", "zh": "确实。希望别变成连阴雨就好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "fce2010cb9c0945650a478725b940cbae6ff56c467913aaaa3ba2720d1a41ad6", "ja": "んー……でも、ま、いっか！\nうまい紅茶、オゴってもらったし。へへ……♪", "zh": "嗯……不过，嘛，算了！\n毕竟你请我喝了好喝的红茶。嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1007_p", "source_sha256": "385db448184b1d1036d7233c8ded50e74a68638e13e9769ea8f3f89981b5b6c3", "ja": "他に何か、食べたいものとかないか？\n好きに頼んでいいぞ。", "zh": "还有什么想吃的吗？\n想点什么就尽管点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "0f22faf359e7cf1fd3d8b7fbd6e7178a395d192728338e80ee05f8843c546627", "ja": "あ、ううん。大丈夫。腹減ってないし。", "zh": "啊，不用了，没事。我还不饿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "40422b1a4d8f6e1605a52e7871f699ece5665a6526238f9f40286b7d7eae4e79", "ja": "でも……{$P$}と\nキャッチボール、したかったな～。", "zh": "不过……本来还想和{$P$}玩一会儿接球的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3f68d770c9ac17348005a85ca4bb28d3d537ec96dd5538c7e8a01f9cacf2dad0", "ja": "（……ひとまず、雨がやむまで。\nもうしばらく様子を見よう）", "zh": "（……总之，先等雨停吧。再观察一会儿）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "c1e31bceff3cd2f006af8d4ef93e8961126ee5b0ff47282509b6ba8c60d1eb76", "ja": "おーっ、すっげー晴れたじゃん！\n風が気持いいぜ～♪", "zh": "哦——！天放晴得真彻底啊！\n风吹得真舒服～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1012_p", "source_sha256": "25a6e4dad5c368184e225485acb342ce7ea29fa23a0a3b003708ab1e982ceac1", "ja": "うん、待ってみてよかったな。\nすっかり、夕方になっちゃったけど……。", "zh": "嗯，多亏等了一下啊。\n虽然都已经完全到傍晚了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "789ddba86409f5b1310bca0b2d51180953a6e82989e664de073ed33adc0e6256", "ja": "だよなー、今からボール投げても、\n見えなくなっちゃうかな……？", "zh": "是啊——现在才开始扔球的话，可能会看不见了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ae47f9dfd51d6b665ed6ae0c7cbf7661ed0bc13d04dc55deef617886c10a8692", "ja": "そうかもな……。\nでもせっかくだから、少し歩こうか？", "zh": "也许吧……\n不过难得出来一趟，要不要走走？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "ac2a8e76d9466ac5ae81dfcf2fe830e0d0b1f15b5a2b1a7e987eb399bf496f79", "ja": "うん！　すぐ帰ったら、なんかもったいないし……。\n……あ、ああっ！？　{$P$}、見て！", "zh": "嗯！要是马上回去，总觉得有点可惜……\n……啊、啊啊！？{$P$}，快看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "8d038736a1b144e94c9a7113d5020ad71c759e7b7951cfdd307007ca539e2bd1", "ja": "虹だよ、虹っ！　うわー、すっげーでっかい！！\nオレ、あんなのはじめて見た……！", "zh": "是彩虹，彩虹！哇——好大一条！！\n我还是第一次看到这么大的彩虹……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f46d73f1ee3a83fcebfd1908b1dbe264883211beac0e894dfc0a8289d4430141", "ja": "おおっ、本当だ！　すごいな……。\nこんな虹が見られるなら、雨もたまにはいいかもな。", "zh": "哦，真的！好壮观啊……\n要是能看到这样的彩虹，偶尔下下雨也不错嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "77a4786b5f2f84da6946495bc5910c6368a03795b6d3170cbb3ffec1302d7ded", "ja": "そうだよな……なんか、トクした気分だよ。\nあははっ、雨のおかげでスッキリしたかも！", "zh": "是啊……总觉得像是赚到了。\n啊哈哈，托雨的福，心情也舒畅多了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "798282e71254956e1e8095e54368f293a662c60150df4fab933c37d4c880610d", "ja": "そうだ、{$P$}！　近くに行ったら\nもっと虹が大きく見えるかもよ！　行ってみようぜ♪", "zh": "对了，{$P$}！靠近一点的话，\n说不定能看到更大的彩虹哦！一起去看看吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ee277fbd20fb9c53b581dab5c9a27d4241226ab431cac82d38d7ff376649defe", "ja": "はは。よし……じゃあ、走るか！", "zh": "哈哈。好……那就跑起来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0243_1021_p", "source_sha256": "fbea7696b4c40b8e45cde3842c30ce0c71c6c6d214cc893c67aa2d9cb3047001", "ja": "（昴はすっかり、いつもの調子を取り戻した。\n元気な姿を見ていると、こっちまで元気になれるな！）", "zh": "（昴已经完全恢复平时的状态了。\n看着她精神十足的样子，连我也跟着打起精神来了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
